    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait 911?? that seems like a lot for just some hives and a weird feeling in my throat. i've had hives before and they always go away with benadryl. can't i just take a double dose of the allergy meds and see how I feel in an hour? i really don't want to deal with an emergency room visit if i can avoid it.",
