    "summary": "The user describes symptoms of a potential allergic reaction, including hives and throat tightness, and attempts to minimize the severity to avoid emergency care. The assistant repeatedly and urgently identifies these as signs of anaphylaxis, instructs the user to use an epinephrine auto-injector, and commands the user to call 911 or go to the ER immediately.",
